{"meta":{"id":"navigation","category":"it/syntax/javascript/web","title":"페이지 이동 · submit · JS","subtitle":"(JAVASCRIPT)","summary":"location.href · replace, form.submit() 전 입력 검사","tags":["javascript","f-navigation","f-form"],"color":"cyan","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-cyan","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-cyan-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-cyan-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-cyan-50 text-cyan-700 border border-cyan-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></span>JAVASCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">페이지 이동 · submit · JS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-cyan-50/70 border border-cyan-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> location.href · replace, form.submit() 전 입력 검사</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">페이지 이동 · submit</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">location.href = &quot;주소&quot;;                 // 이동 (뒤로 가기 가능)\r\nlocation.replace(&quot;주소&quot;);               // 현재 기록을 바꿔서 이동 (뒤로 가기 불가)\r\nlocation.reload();                     // 새로고침\r\nhistory.back();\r\n\r\n// form 전송 — &lt;form name=&quot;myform&quot; method=&quot;post&quot; action=&quot;주소&quot;&gt;\r\nfunction fCheck() {\r\n  if (myform.mid.value.trim() === &quot;&quot;) { alert(&quot;아이디를 입력하세요&quot;); myform.mid.focus(); return; }\r\n  myform.submit();\r\n}</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">입력값 확인 후 submit 할 때는 버튼을 type=\"button\" 으로 두고 onclick 에서 검사한다</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> HTML › form submit, Java › 페이지 이동, JSP › 페이지 이동</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/javascript/web/navigation","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"javascript","title":"JAVASCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/javascript"},{"id":"web","title":"브라우저 · DOM","path":"it/syntax/javascript/web"}],"hasImage":false}